  "question": {
    "text": "The locus of a point which moves such that the difference of its distances from the points <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5,0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5,0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is <math><mn>6</mn></math>&nbsp;units is a conic, whose length of the latus rectum (in units) is equal to",
